This folder will backup LaghosScal5 i.e. the rewrite of LaghosScal. There are a few goals.

1. Get igr working with CUDA and Partial Assembly.
2. Rewrite the previous code base in a more streamlined version. This means no more calculating igr randomly as an inserted block, but instead giving it a proper method like how the rhs of velocity and energy are calculated.
3. Previous versions added the bulk of edits to "IGR" versions of the files, but this is not universally true. The new IGR files should be standalone.

Thus by readding portions step by step we can see what breaks the code and how pieces should be implemented efficiently.
